Move userscript metadata finalization into a Vite writeBundle plugin so both production builds and `vite build --watch` emit an installable Tampermonkey userscript.

Validation on a fresh checkout of head `abb3677ed20efbf82f5f1f1a4ff54c8ee546c338`:
- `bun run check` passed;
- `bun run build` passed;
- generated userscript header inspected;
- watch mode built successfully, then rebuilt after a source file change, and the metadata header remained intact.
